{
  "_note": "The agent apps Poiesis knows how to drive (CLI-2). An agent that is not listed here is never found automatically: the user adds it by hand. Every entry was recorded against a real session (fixtures/engines/) before it was written; Gemini CLI, Qwen Code, Kimi Code, Copilot CLI and Cline were recorded signed out by oh-my-hermes (fixtures/engines/omher/). `tested_from` is the version that was recorded, `tested_below` is the first one nobody has looked at. Never add a command here that prints secrets (OpenCode's `auth export` is the example).",
